WEBVTT

00:28:59.320 --> 00:29:01.486
and the author of "The Likability Trap,"

00:29:01.510 --> 00:29:05.436
a book about the pressure women face
to be who other people want them to be.

00:29:05.460 --> 00:29:07.606
AM: I sometimes get the sense,

00:29:07.630 --> 00:29:10.806
and other women I spoke with
got the sense,

00:29:10.830 --> 00:29:14.347
that when they were told, "Be yourself,"

00:29:15.800 --> 00:29:18.146
it wasn't, "Be whoever that is."

00:29:18.170 --> 00:29:23.246
It was, "Be who I expect
that person to be,

00:29:23.270 --> 00:29:27.206
predicated on your gender, your race,

00:29:27.230 --> 00:29:30.083
your ethnicity, how old you are,